WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 28]

01:34.830 --> 01:36.820
I can't believe
such a hand cannon does exist.

01:36.840 --> 01:38.000
This is different.

01:38.039 --> 01:39.379
Young Lady brought it out.

01:39.399 --> 01:40.420
From where?

01:40.440 --> 01:41.559
Divine Temple.

01:42.720 --> 01:44.839
She brought this from the Divine Temple?

01:44.879 --> 01:46.299
Yet, the main component is missing.

01:46.319 --> 01:47.479
It's damaged.

01:47.599 --> 01:48.620
Who damaged it?

01:48.640 --> 01:49.930
You don't need to know that.

01:49.950 --> 01:51.340
The only thing you need to do is

01:51.360 --> 01:53.639
to learn this

01:53.679 --> 01:54.960
and protect Fan Xian.

01:56.720 --> 01:57.839
And?

01:57.920 --> 01:59.180
Can you fix it?

01:59.200 --> 02:00.440
Not me.

02:12.360 --> 02:13.699
Protecting Fan Xian

02:13.719 --> 02:14.959
is a secret.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.040
I won't tell anyone.

02:17.360 --> 02:18.460
Not even to Xian?

02:18.480 --> 02:19.499
Yes.

02:19.519 --> 02:20.759
But why me?

02:20.839 --> 02:22.300
What matters the most to you

02:22.320 --> 02:24.099
in this world?

02:24.119 --> 02:25.420
Xian, of course.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.919
And that's the reason why.

02:34.800 --> 02:36.359
He just left like that?

02:41.360 --> 02:43.900
Do you understand what Mr. Fan said?

02:43.920 --> 02:45.320
Me neither.

02:48.800 --> 02:49.610
See you tonight.

02:49.630 --> 02:50.239
See you tonight.

02:50.239 --> 02:51.259
I'm leaving.

02:51.279 --> 02:52.359
Hurry.

03:11.239 --> 03:12.539
See you later.

03:12.559 --> 03:13.759
See you then.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.219
What's it about?

03:42.239 --> 03:45.060
I saw those merchants releasing pigeons

03:45.080 --> 03:45.839
out there.

03:45.839 --> 03:46.679
I'm curious,

03:46.679 --> 03:48.239
so I caught one.

03:49.959 --> 03:52.000
Did they send this to the Capital?

03:52.239 --> 03:55.440
They informed them
about what happened here.

03:56.040 --> 03:56.860
Why?

03:56.880 --> 03:59.170
Aren't they the owners
of their business?

03:59.190 --> 04:00.160
Can't they decide on their own

04:00.160 --> 04:01.499
whether or not to buy the treasury bonds?

04:01.519 --> 04:03.959
How could a rootless tree
stand on its own?

04:04.959 --> 04:07.560
Are you saying that they have backing?

04:07.800 --> 04:08.880
Apparently.

04:10.600 --> 04:12.060
Well, I will release it.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.480
Don't dissect the pigeon.

04:13.480 --> 04:14.560
All right?

04:19.400 --> 04:21.559
Fan Sizhe, you were impressive.

04:21.570 --> 04:23.390
You were talking in front of everyone.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.440
Of course.

04:25.759 --> 04:26.839
Ruoruo,

04:26.999 --> 04:28.199
let me tell you this.

04:28.239 --> 04:30.659
It's true that Fan Xian's idea
is stupendous.

04:30.679 --> 04:31.890
It's totally new to me.

04:31.910 --> 04:33.560
But you should look at it this way.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.299
Even I have never heard of them,

04:35.319 --> 04:37.120
how would those merchants understand?

04:37.960 --> 04:39.700
Those terms Fan Xian mentioned

04:39.720 --> 04:42.059
like "national prospect"

04:42.079 --> 04:42.999
and "wealth".

04:42.999 --> 04:43.660
Those officials

04:43.679 --> 04:45.619
and merchants can't fathom the concept.

04:45.639 --> 04:47.719
The only term to impress them is

04:48.239 --> 04:49.440
"royalty".

04:50.600 --> 04:52.159
You are happy about this.

04:52.879 --> 04:54.219
Of course I am.

04:54.239 --> 04:55.820
Still,

04:55.840 --> 04:57.599
I feel that something is missing,

04:59.119 --> 05:00.959
which worries me.

05:01.879 --> 05:03.270
What are you worried about?

05:03.639 --> 05:05.059
At first, I thought

05:05.079 --> 05:06.360
they would be intimidated

05:06.370 --> 05:08.580
by the very mention of His Majesty
and would hand over their money.

05:08.600 --> 05:09.859
But you see,

05:09.879 --> 05:12.159
they sent messages back to the Capital.

05:12.990 --> 05:14.240
What's wrong with that?

05:14.960 --> 05:17.360
The treasury bonds
have never been done before.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.719
I'm afraid

05:18.960 --> 05:20.979
this goes against the state law.

05:20.999 --> 05:22.270
Don't worry about that.

05:22.600 --> 05:23.680
Well, good.

05:24.999 --> 05:26.739
You led the second half.

05:26.759 --> 05:28.340
You gave them an absolute promise.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.460
If anything happens,

05:29.480 --> 05:30.880
you will take the fall.

05:34.800 --> 05:36.599
He couldn't be plotting this, could he?

05:36.999 --> 05:38.599
I was helping him.

05:40.639 --> 05:41.719
Gosh.

05:41.920 --> 05:42.639
No.

05:42.639 --> 05:43.319
That's impossible.

05:43.319 --> 05:45.399
We are quite close now.

05:46.400 --> 05:48.440
Right, he won't do this to me.

05:48.840 --> 05:50.000
The treasury bonds

05:50.239 --> 05:51.739
aren't considered illegal, right?

05:51.759 --> 05:53.800
Of course they are.

05:54.480 --> 05:55.959
Treasury bonds?

05:56.360 --> 05:58.140
I have never heard of this

05:58.160 --> 06:00.440
since the founding of the Qing State.

06:00.960 --> 06:03.900
He is utterly a rebellious brat!

06:03.920 --> 06:06.340
Sharing the burden of the imperial debt,
he says?

06:06.360 --> 06:07.820
Such absurdity!

06:07.840 --> 06:09.340
This is against the state law!

06:09.360 --> 06:10.800
As the saying goes,

06:11.119 --> 06:13.539
"Parents are to blame
for children's mistakes."

06:13.559 --> 06:14.920
I suggest

06:15.439 --> 06:17.580
escorting Fan Xian back

06:17.600 --> 06:19.839
and removing me from my position.

06:20.639 --> 06:21.979
With a mischievous son like him,

06:21.999 --> 06:23.760
I'm too ashamed to remain an official.

06:24.280 --> 06:27.639
I might as well resign
and return to Danzhou.

06:44.480 --> 06:46.800
Mr. Chen, wake up.

06:48.439 --> 06:51.859
Why wake me up when you are lashing out?

06:51.879 --> 06:53.560
Tell us

06:53.879 --> 06:55.599
about your view on treasury bonds.

06:57.439 --> 06:58.759
I don't have any views.

06:58.920 --> 06:59.979
Are you blind?

06:59.999 --> 07:03.279
The Imperial Treasury isn't under
the Imperial Inspectorate's supervision.

07:03.990 --> 07:04.979
I can't do anything about it.

07:04.999 --> 07:06.659
We are not talking
about the Imperial Treasury.

07:06.679 --> 07:07.900
It's the treasury bonds.

07:07.920 --> 07:09.519
That's new.

07:10.280 --> 07:11.790
I have never heard of that.

07:11.999 --> 07:13.279
Indeed.

07:14.040 --> 07:15.330
The treasury bonds

07:15.350 --> 07:17.219
have never been heard of since ancient.

07:17.239 --> 07:18.700
According to the law of the Qing State,

07:18.720 --> 07:20.700
there aren't any terms concerning
the treasury bonds.

07:20.720 --> 07:23.000
No laws could be based on

07:23.160 --> 07:25.000
if he were to be punished.

07:25.639 --> 07:27.120
Such novelty.

07:27.890 --> 07:29.640
What do you think about this, Chengze?

07:32.079 --> 07:33.599
Your Highness,

07:33.679 --> 07:35.199
I'm still grounded for reflection.

07:35.199 --> 07:37.419
Without His Majesty's summon,
I wouldn't dare step out of the room,

07:37.439 --> 07:39.639
let alone intervene in state affairs.

07:40.759 --> 07:42.240
It's fine. Just speak up.

07:45.079 --> 07:46.399
No laws

07:46.639 --> 07:48.000
or reasons to be based on,

07:48.319 --> 07:50.120
only His Majesty could decide.

07:57.319 --> 07:58.580
You are all here.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.000
Please come with me.

08:01.688 --> 08:03.079
Where is His Majesty?

08:03.239 --> 08:04.380
I don't know.

08:04.400 --> 08:06.780
You don't know?
Then where are you taking us to?

08:06.800 --> 08:08.159
The Imperial Garden.

08:11.160 --> 08:14.159
Why are we going to the harem's garden

08:14.550 --> 08:15.880
in the middle of the night?

08:16.119 --> 08:17.520
To transplant flowers.

08:41.800 --> 08:42.999
Eunuch Hou.

08:44.120 --> 08:47.199
Are you sure
this is His Majesty's order?

08:47.240 --> 08:48.260
Mr. Fan,

08:48.280 --> 08:50.260
I would never dare

08:50.280 --> 08:53.479
fabricate orders from His Majesty.

08:55.719 --> 08:57.719
What exactly is going on?

09:00.719 --> 09:02.419
Just transplanting the flowers.

09:02.439 --> 09:03.839
Only a few of us?

09:04.920 --> 09:06.260
Where are the servants?

09:08.000 --> 09:10.280
His Majesty banned the servants

09:10.439 --> 09:11.860
from entering

09:11.880 --> 09:14.599
this area.

09:42.520 --> 09:44.959
Mr. Fan, thank you for your hard work.

09:48.199 --> 09:50.900
The Chrysanthemum Festival
is held every three years.

09:50.920 --> 09:53.040
It was held
at the Hanging Temple, right?

09:53.439 --> 09:54.959
Indeed.

09:55.479 --> 09:57.179
These are just ordinary flowers.

09:57.199 --> 09:59.140
Why do we have
to deliver them personally?

09:59.160 --> 10:00.959
His Majesty likes them.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.699
His Majesty is telling us

10:06.719 --> 10:07.839
that he cares

10:07.839 --> 10:09.530
about the Chrysanthemum Festival.

10:09.679 --> 10:11.920
But why is he telling us now?

10:15.319 --> 10:16.920
I remember the festival
in previous years

10:16.920 --> 10:18.100
weren't held at this time.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.320
It's rescheduled.

10:21.480 --> 10:22.659
Until when?

10:22.679 --> 10:24.239
Just recently.

10:24.520 --> 10:26.020
We have to wait

10:26.040 --> 10:26.970
for the exact date.

10:26.990 --> 10:28.320
What are we waiting for?

10:28.359 --> 10:29.699
We have to wait

10:29.719 --> 10:31.839
until Mr. Fan returns from Mount Cang.

10:34.359 --> 10:35.520
Why do we need to wait for him

10:35.520 --> 10:37.299
before deciding the date?

10:37.319 --> 10:39.239
This is what His Majesty said.

10:39.479 --> 10:42.539
His Majesty values
the Chrysanthemum Festival,

10:42.559 --> 10:43.800
but the date will be announced

10:43.800 --> 10:45.800
only after Fan Xian returns.

10:46.040 --> 10:48.100
That's right, Your Highness.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.990
His Majesty is trying to remind us

10:50.010 --> 10:51.599
that the Chrysanthemum Festival
is important,

10:51.599 --> 10:52.920
but Fan Xian

10:53.760 --> 10:54.999
is more important.

11:09.199 --> 11:11.719
Did you leave it in the Capital?

11:12.240 --> 11:13.599
I carried it from the carriage myself

11:13.599 --> 11:14.879
and put it in your room.

11:14.920 --> 11:16.380
A big box

11:16.400 --> 11:18.280
couldn't just vanish into thin air.

11:18.959 --> 11:20.560
What's inside the box?

11:20.719 --> 11:22.560
It's from the Divine Temple.

11:22.800 --> 11:24.599
The Divine Temple?

11:24.719 --> 11:26.220
Is it some powerful weapon?

11:26.240 --> 11:28.680
It is if the components are complete.

11:28.920 --> 11:29.830
Does it miss a piece?

11:29.850 --> 11:31.560
The main component is missing.

11:32.760 --> 11:34.900
Nothing is missing in this room.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.579
Only the box disappeared.

11:36.599 --> 11:39.665
It means the person who took it
knows what is inside.

11:39.685 --> 11:41.646
Not many know about this.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.080
Who's there?

11:47.319 --> 11:47.980
Mr. Fan,

11:48.000 --> 11:49.479
someone is there!

11:51.000 --> 11:51.939
Good skills.

11:51.959 --> 11:53.260
I didn't even notice.

11:53.280 --> 11:54.459
Wang, protect Wan'er.

11:54.479 --> 11:55.559
Yes.

12:32.079 --> 12:33.199
Master.

12:39.000 --> 12:40.199
My dear.

12:45.079 --> 12:46.199
Commander Jing?

12:46.440 --> 12:47.780
Haven't you got back to the encampment?

12:47.800 --> 12:49.020
Black Cavalries are ordered

12:49.040 --> 12:51.440
to stand guard at Mount Cang
and protect you.

12:53.599 --> 12:54.839
Shadow?

12:55.920 --> 12:58.220
Wang Qinian is quite cautious.

12:58.240 --> 13:00.579
Turns out
it's the Imperial Inspectorate.

13:00.599 --> 13:02.079
Is this a team building event?

13:03.839 --> 13:05.780
What is team building?

13:05.800 --> 13:07.400
We always have novel terms here.

13:07.439 --> 13:09.280
Just get used to it.

13:10.560 --> 13:11.420
Master,

13:11.440 --> 13:13.040
what brings you to Mount Cang?

13:13.479 --> 13:15.199
Because you are here.

13:15.400 --> 13:16.599
Mr. Fan,

13:17.000 --> 13:18.719
did you lose anything?

13:19.640 --> 13:21.160
You were eavesdropping on us.

13:22.559 --> 13:24.860
I think Mr. Wu does it.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.079
What do you mean?

13:26.479 --> 13:28.879
He has been secretly following you

13:28.920 --> 13:31.999
and waiting for a chance
to spar with Mr. Wu.

13:32.439 --> 13:33.599
Mr. Fan,

13:33.679 --> 13:35.760
you are his disciple.

13:35.959 --> 13:37.120
Why don't we

13:37.120 --> 13:38.740
have a match?

13:38.760 --> 13:39.840
Stay still

13:40.359 --> 13:41.999
or I will poison you.

13:43.520 --> 13:46.160
There is nothing else here, right?

13:47.120 --> 13:48.440
I think so.

13:49.359 --> 13:50.440
Retreat.

13:52.319 --> 13:53.839
Just ignore us.

13:54.800 --> 13:57.520
Forget I exist.

14:01.120 --> 14:02.220
What's wrong with them?

14:02.240 --> 14:03.719
So secretive.

14:04.400 --> 14:05.880
Let's go, Master.
You have come to Mount Cang,

14:05.880 --> 14:06.980
let's get supper at my place.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.220
Sorry, it's this way.

14:08.240 --> 14:09.300
Hold on.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.920
I have to tell you something.

14:12.160 --> 14:14.999
I went to Jiangnan for a murder case.

14:15.479 --> 14:17.839
The murderer disappeared

14:17.990 --> 14:19.600
after he arrived in the Capital.

14:19.839 --> 14:20.860
Two possibilities.

14:20.880 --> 14:22.490
Either it's Mr. Wu...

14:22.510 --> 14:24.199
What is the other possibility?

14:25.839 --> 14:27.680
Someone hid this murderer

14:28.400 --> 14:30.520
in the Capital.

14:30.950 --> 14:33.099
Not even the Imperial Inspectorate
could track him down.

14:33.119 --> 14:34.239
Of course,

14:35.319 --> 14:36.559
only a few in the Capital

14:36.559 --> 14:38.479
are capable of that.

14:39.359 --> 14:41.879
Well, this is also a clue.

14:43.760 --> 14:46.879
I came here to spend some days with you.

14:48.079 --> 14:50.560
This case spooks me.

14:53.240 --> 14:56.239
I will follow up on this
after returning to the Capital.

14:56.820 --> 14:57.920
I was planning to meet up with you

14:57.920 --> 15:00.280
after getting the result.

15:02.000 --> 15:03.199
I will lie low for now.

15:04.679 --> 15:05.759
Master.

15:09.319 --> 15:11.400
You have almost cured

15:11.479 --> 15:13.599
Wan'er's lung disease.

15:13.719 --> 15:14.980
Give this to her.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.280
Take one pill every day.

15:17.000 --> 15:18.320
She will recover

15:18.560 --> 15:20.079
by the time she finishes these.

15:23.880 --> 15:25.680
I wish you a happy marriage.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.459
This is what His Majesty and I

15:28.479 --> 15:30.160
are eager to see.

15:32.679 --> 15:34.939
You should resign.
I will look after you.

15:34.959 --> 15:36.179
Nonsense.

15:36.199 --> 15:36.900
I'm serious.

15:36.920 --> 15:38.000
Enough of that.

15:38.959 --> 15:41.280
A grandmaster is hiding in the Capital.

15:42.400 --> 15:44.260
I won't rest

15:44.280 --> 15:45.999
until I find him.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.200
Master.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.839
Enough of nagging.

15:49.319 --> 15:51.199
Hurry and have a child.

15:52.440 --> 15:54.119
I will teach him poisoning skills

15:54.400 --> 15:55.839
when he grows up.

15:57.920 --> 15:59.000
I'm off.

16:00.160 --> 16:01.440
Promise me.

16:01.520 --> 16:02.600
Don't take risks.

16:02.839 --> 16:03.919
Don't worry.

16:04.110 --> 16:05.680
I'm more afraid of dying than you.

16:28.760 --> 16:30.040
Mr. Wuzhu?

16:34.160 --> 16:35.719
You took the box.

16:39.119 --> 16:40.140
Come with me.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.359
Wait... Have you been sitting here?

16:41.359 --> 16:42.879
No one sees you?

16:43.920 --> 16:45.079
It makes sense.

16:46.160 --> 16:47.800
You are different.

16:56.760 --> 16:57.840
Mr. Wuzhu,

16:57.880 --> 16:59.819
it seems Shadow is interested in you.

16:59.839 --> 17:01.030
He always expects a spar with you.

17:01.040 --> 17:02.280
I'm not interested.

17:44.079 --> 17:46.439
What are you looking for?

18:18.600 --> 18:20.310
Is there something inside here?

18:26.399 --> 18:28.670
Young Lady stayed in Mount Cang for a while.

18:43.440 --> 18:44.540
My mother hid this?

18:44.560 --> 18:46.159
It should've been destroyed,

18:46.879 --> 18:48.200
just like this box.

18:51.119 --> 18:52.839
My mother destroyed this?

18:52.879 --> 18:53.819
Why?

18:53.839 --> 18:55.280
To observe the law.

18:55.480 --> 18:57.180
Anything ahead of its time

18:57.200 --> 18:58.439
shouldn't remain.

18:58.559 --> 18:59.879
Whose law?

19:00.000 --> 19:01.099
The Divine Temple's?

19:01.119 --> 19:02.220
Maybe.

19:02.240 --> 19:03.320
Maybe?

19:05.680 --> 19:06.760
I forgot.

19:10.559 --> 19:12.040
If that's the case,

19:13.480 --> 19:15.240
why didn't she destroy all these?

19:18.520 --> 19:20.180
And why did she leave behind
these three things?

19:20.200 --> 19:21.919
Anything ahead of its time

19:22.040 --> 19:24.200
shouldn't remain in this reset world.

19:24.280 --> 19:27.000
History mustn't be affected.

19:29.079 --> 19:30.399
But you are different.

19:30.879 --> 19:32.320
You are a mistake.

19:32.800 --> 19:33.919
A mistake?

19:34.240 --> 19:36.099
You belong to both this world

19:36.119 --> 19:38.280
and the past.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.119
You are a mistake,

19:40.919 --> 19:42.159
a glitch,

19:42.599 --> 19:44.079
an unknown variable,

19:44.839 --> 19:46.359
and a flawed logic.

19:47.480 --> 19:49.079
That's what Young Lady said.

19:51.280 --> 19:53.000
Did part of my memories

19:53.760 --> 19:55.280
come from the Divine Temple?

19:57.240 --> 19:58.320
I don't know.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.679
I'm just restating her words.

20:01.639 --> 20:02.980
What Young Lady left for you

20:03.000 --> 20:04.520
is a chance to survive.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.159
Fix it

20:06.240 --> 20:08.839
and you will have three chances
to change your destiny.

20:10.119 --> 20:11.199
How to fix it?

20:13.359 --> 20:14.480
Go to Jiangnan.

20:14.600 --> 20:16.240
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

20:26.800 --> 20:28.170
The Three Great Workshops

20:28.190 --> 20:30.320
are the foundation
of the Imperial Treasury.

20:31.559 --> 20:32.980
Everyone knows that.

20:33.000 --> 20:34.260
The Imperial Treasury used to base

20:34.280 --> 20:36.059
on the Three Great Workshops.

20:36.079 --> 20:38.020
All those novel things in the past

20:38.040 --> 20:39.700
came from Jiangnan.

20:39.720 --> 20:40.780
Do you know

20:40.800 --> 20:42.879
who owns the Three Great Workshops now?

20:42.879 --> 20:44.940
The Ming family in Jiangnan, of course.

20:44.960 --> 20:47.919
The Ming family has always followed
the Eldest Princess.

20:48.000 --> 20:50.099
I doubt they would hand over
the Three Great Workshops.

20:50.119 --> 20:52.780
Even though
they are affluent in Jiangnan,

20:52.800 --> 20:54.339
they dare not defy the decree.

20:54.359 --> 20:56.480
They won't, for sure.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.439
What to hand over

20:58.720 --> 21:00.020
and how?

21:00.040 --> 21:01.460
It has its own rules.

21:01.480 --> 21:02.980
I suppose we merchants

21:03.000 --> 21:04.539
are well aware of that.

21:04.559 --> 21:05.539
In that case,

21:05.559 --> 21:07.220
it's very unlikely for Fan Xian

21:07.240 --> 21:09.079
to take over the Imperial Treasury.

21:09.319 --> 21:10.020
That's right.

21:10.040 --> 21:12.200
Let's not fall into his trap.

21:12.240 --> 21:14.180
How will he repay us

21:14.200 --> 21:15.899
if we buy the treasury bonds?

21:15.919 --> 21:17.220
You are right.

21:17.240 --> 21:18.020
We won't buy them.

21:18.040 --> 21:19.439
If so,

21:19.520 --> 21:21.180
let's leave first thing in the morning.

21:21.200 --> 21:23.439
Whoever buys them is a jerk.

21:24.000 --> 21:24.660
Yes.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.760
Whoever buys them is a jerk!

21:26.960 --> 21:27.859
Jerk.

21:27.879 --> 21:28.600
Come on.

21:28.620 --> 21:29.700
Let's drink.

21:33.119 --> 21:35.079
This is a product beyond our time.

21:35.080 --> 21:36.599
What exactly is
in the Three Great Workshops?

21:36.599 --> 21:38.139
How do they manage to fix this?

21:38.159 --> 21:40.560
You will find out when you get there.

21:41.200 --> 21:43.040
I'm going to Jiangnan anyhow.

21:43.359 --> 21:44.619
I must retrieve

21:44.639 --> 21:46.159
my mother's property.

21:49.639 --> 21:51.819
Why didn't she put them together

21:51.839 --> 21:53.679
in this box?

21:55.280 --> 21:56.960
Young Lady left this for you,

21:57.000 --> 21:59.040
but she didn't want you
to have it fixed.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.599
Why?

22:12.320 --> 22:14.480
When the Divine Temple
alters someone's destiny,

22:14.599 --> 22:17.280
the future will leave its mark.

22:18.200 --> 22:20.159
That doesn't make sense to me.

22:21.079 --> 22:23.200
If the items of the Divine Temple
are overly used,

22:23.319 --> 22:24.800
you will eventually end up

22:25.159 --> 22:26.899
in the Divine Temple.

22:26.919 --> 22:28.890
This sounds rather surreal.

22:28.910 --> 22:30.310
I will wait
until you arrive in Jiangnan.

22:30.320 --> 22:31.300
You will only grow the courage

22:31.319 --> 22:33.420
to face the Grandmasters by then.

22:33.440 --> 22:35.060
Isn't it unfair

22:35.080 --> 22:36.500
to use it against Grandmasters?

22:36.520 --> 22:37.460
Not really.

22:37.480 --> 22:38.679
What does that mean?

22:38.839 --> 22:41.099
I might not defeat Grandmasters
even with this?

22:41.119 --> 22:42.199
Exactly.

22:42.639 --> 22:44.020
Grandmasters are human.

22:44.040 --> 22:46.359
How can they possibly dodge
such an advanced weapon?

22:50.000 --> 22:51.599
Do you think I'm normal?

22:52.639 --> 22:54.059
Grandmasters

22:54.079 --> 22:56.090
aren't held back
by the usual limitations.

22:56.110 --> 22:57.760
Doesn't that make them monsters?

23:00.480 --> 23:01.560
Pretty much so.

23:52.000 --> 23:52.890
News from the palace says

23:52.910 --> 23:54.420
that His Majesty summons Fan Xian back

23:54.440 --> 23:56.030
for the Chrysanthemum Festival.

23:57.320 --> 23:58.650
What about the treasury bonds?

23:58.670 --> 24:00.240
His Majesty didn't mention that.

24:26.190 --> 24:27.420
Have you heard about that?

24:27.440 --> 24:28.899
The Chrysanthemum Festival?

24:28.919 --> 24:30.980
That's not important.

24:31.000 --> 24:32.539
His Majesty waits for Fan Xian

24:32.559 --> 24:34.139
probably because he writes good poems.

24:34.159 --> 24:35.520
Yes, you are right.

24:36.119 --> 24:39.339
His literary talents aren't good enough

24:39.359 --> 24:42.460
to handle the Imperial Treasury.

24:42.480 --> 24:43.319
Exactly.

24:43.319 --> 24:44.520
Where are you going?

24:44.879 --> 24:45.959
Well,

24:46.079 --> 24:47.379
I'm going to the loo.

24:47.399 --> 24:50.119
I always go for a walk after waking up.

24:50.359 --> 24:51.379
Please go ahead.

24:51.399 --> 24:52.560
See you later.

24:53.480 --> 24:55.159
Oh, it's this way.

25:04.839 --> 25:06.500
Didn't you go for a walk?

25:06.520 --> 25:08.159
Is this the loo?

25:08.240 --> 25:09.180
Oh, my.

25:09.200 --> 25:11.399
How did you end up here from a walk?

25:17.960 --> 25:19.399
It must be the right choice.

25:25.240 --> 25:26.439
You...

25:27.240 --> 25:28.940
Mr. Fan,

25:28.960 --> 25:30.639
remember to reserve
50,000 taels of bonds

25:30.639 --> 25:31.980
for me.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.619
I'm heading back to get money.

25:33.639 --> 25:35.399
I will come back later.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.420
Why are you here too?

25:38.440 --> 25:40.480
Did you forget what you said yesterday?

25:40.680 --> 25:42.200
He's a jerk.

25:42.680 --> 25:43.879
And this jerk

25:44.359 --> 25:46.000
bought the treasury bonds.

25:46.520 --> 25:48.159
I'm leaving.

26:22.119 --> 26:22.559
Take a rest.

26:22.559 --> 26:23.559
[Treasury Bonds]

26:23.559 --> 26:24.420
Thanks.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.760
Wan'er, wipe your hands.

26:32.839 --> 26:35.460
Xian, the figure doesn't match up.

26:35.480 --> 26:37.000
Maybe someone
didn't bring enough banknotes

26:37.000 --> 26:38.280
and go home to get some.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.879
I did a rough calculation.

26:39.879 --> 26:41.639
It's more than 20 million taels.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.579
The bonds are limited
and sold at a premium price.

26:44.599 --> 26:45.819
It's all thanks to you

26:45.839 --> 26:47.000
to sell them off.

26:48.040 --> 26:50.180
The treasury bonds are sold off.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.800
Why are you unhappy?

26:52.319 --> 26:54.220
They bought the treasury bonds

26:54.240 --> 26:56.830
because His Majesty invited me
to the Chrysanthemum Festival.

26:58.000 --> 27:00.480
You should appreciate His Majesty
for his grace.

27:00.520 --> 27:02.059
Now that they choose to share the debt,

27:02.079 --> 27:03.299
from now on,

27:03.319 --> 27:06.520
you are their backer.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.800
True.

27:07.919 --> 27:09.560
This is an investment.

27:10.440 --> 27:13.539
However, no one truly understands

27:13.559 --> 27:15.679
what the treasury bonds mean.

27:21.919 --> 27:24.139
If national prospect
is related to currency,

27:24.159 --> 27:27.079
it means what wealth holds

27:27.079 --> 27:29.359
has far surpassed the limitations
in the past.

27:30.119 --> 27:31.180
Xian,

27:31.200 --> 27:33.339
I have been pondering what you said.

27:33.359 --> 27:36.399
I doubt that national prospect alone

27:36.800 --> 27:39.500
can affect the Qing State
and its wealth.

27:39.520 --> 27:41.599
There must be more connections
between them.

27:44.159 --> 27:47.500
Due to His Majesty's favor for you,

27:47.520 --> 27:49.820
those merchants chose to believe
in the treasury bonds

27:49.840 --> 27:51.800
and the outlook
of the Imperial Treasury.

27:52.639 --> 27:55.480
In fact, what they value isn't only you,

27:55.839 --> 27:57.240
but also His Majesty,

27:57.919 --> 27:59.839
royal credibility,

27:59.960 --> 28:01.260
and the Qing State's credibility.

28:01.280 --> 28:02.360
Exactly.

28:02.399 --> 28:03.559
The amount of money is limited.

28:03.559 --> 28:06.379
However, the Qing State's credibility
is the base of its currency.

28:06.399 --> 28:07.679
That's right.

28:08.150 --> 28:09.619
It doesn't just apply to the Qing State.

28:09.639 --> 28:10.980
The credibility of Northern Qi

28:11.000 --> 28:12.899
also represents its own wealth.

28:12.919 --> 28:15.040
In short, state credibility
equals its wealth.

28:18.119 --> 28:19.439
State credibility

28:20.000 --> 28:21.240
is the wealth

28:21.800 --> 28:23.280
and the base of its currency.

28:24.240 --> 28:27.200
But what's missing between them?

28:31.319 --> 28:32.399
Currency.

28:32.919 --> 28:34.000
Credibility.

28:35.159 --> 28:36.280
Let's go out

28:36.319 --> 28:38.399
and let him figure it out himself.

28:38.639 --> 28:39.760
Currency.

28:40.040 --> 28:41.200
Wealth.

28:46.480 --> 28:47.599
Credibility.

28:47.919 --> 28:49.119
Wealth.

28:59.040 --> 29:00.200
Currency.

29:01.040 --> 29:02.240
Credibility.

29:14.359 --> 29:16.200
What's wrong with Sizhe?

29:18.240 --> 29:19.919
He's discovered a new world.

29:20.520 --> 29:23.059
He is certainly a genius

29:23.079 --> 29:24.599
in commerce.

29:25.079 --> 29:26.260
Both of you are geniuses.

29:26.280 --> 29:27.439
We are different.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.099
I have a special memory.

29:29.119 --> 29:31.320
That's considered cheating.

29:31.800 --> 29:33.070
If we were to switch with each other,

29:33.079 --> 29:35.020
at least I'm not as insightful as he is

29:35.040 --> 29:36.399
in commerce.

29:37.359 --> 29:39.320
He's better than me.

29:40.040 --> 29:41.599
That's good.

29:43.599 --> 29:44.679
Wan'er,

29:44.720 --> 29:45.839
I'm sorry.

29:47.319 --> 29:48.099
What's wrong?

29:48.119 --> 29:50.800
We might need to leave Mount Cang soon.

29:51.800 --> 29:52.980
Of course.

29:53.000 --> 29:55.879
His Majesty is waiting for you
to attend the Chrysanthemum Festival.

29:57.919 --> 29:59.410
I have prepared for so long.

29:59.430 --> 30:01.100
But he simply could make it happen

30:01.599 --> 30:03.079
with a word.

30:05.079 --> 30:06.379
The Emperor

30:06.399 --> 30:09.599
has always been the center of the state.

30:10.159 --> 30:11.780
When the Chrysanthemum Festival is over,

30:11.800 --> 30:13.439
let's go to Jiangnan.

30:14.639 --> 30:15.919
Am I tagging along too?

30:17.240 --> 30:19.839
My mother established
the Three Great Workshops in Jiangnan.

30:20.119 --> 30:21.310
Up to this day,

30:21.330 --> 30:23.580
it's still the foundation
of the Imperial Treasury.

30:24.280 --> 30:26.480
These are the traces she left
in this world.

30:27.240 --> 30:28.320
I think

30:32.240 --> 30:34.140
we should go
and check them out together.

30:45.520 --> 30:49.200
If state credibility
is connected to currency,

30:49.480 --> 30:51.599
to maintain the balance between them,

30:51.720 --> 30:53.520
we need a shop.

30:55.720 --> 30:57.760
But I have never seen one before.

30:59.040 --> 31:02.040
What should I name this shop?

31:11.720 --> 31:12.980
Get a hand cannon

31:13.000 --> 31:14.240
and practice aiming.

31:14.520 --> 31:16.679
Your hands are steady.
You have potential in this.

31:19.680 --> 31:21.040
Protecting Fan Xian

31:21.079 --> 31:22.320
is a secret.

31:23.040 --> 31:24.500
Do you want me to protect Xian

31:24.520 --> 31:26.379
from a grandmaster?

31:26.399 --> 31:27.480
No,

31:27.599 --> 31:28.839
you have to kill him.

31:28.919 --> 31:30.539
Kill a grandmaster.

31:30.559 --> 31:32.200
It could also be me.

32:01.960 --> 32:03.960
How much longer
are they going to stand there?

32:06.240 --> 32:07.800
If you disturb them,

32:08.680 --> 32:10.320
I will poison you.

32:11.559 --> 32:12.539
Do you think

32:12.559 --> 32:14.320
Mr. Wu would show up today?

32:15.319 --> 32:17.439
Whether or not he shows up,

32:18.480 --> 32:20.800
just forget about the spar.

32:21.159 --> 32:22.679
You are no match for him.

32:24.710 --> 32:26.280
What I care about isn't the result.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.660
You are a martial artist.

32:27.680 --> 32:29.000
You should know that.

32:29.119 --> 32:31.000
I'm not a martial artist.

32:31.639 --> 32:32.879
What are you, then?

32:34.960 --> 32:36.599
I'm his master.

32:38.800 --> 32:40.679
Do you see him as your disciple

32:41.000 --> 32:42.320
or your son?

32:47.119 --> 32:49.580
It seems that Mr. Wu
won't show up today.

32:49.600 --> 32:51.310
I will head back to the Capital first.

32:51.520 --> 32:52.720
Please be careful.

32:53.280 --> 32:55.520
If Wuzhu is proven to be the murderer,

32:55.680 --> 32:57.720
no one will survive.

33:11.200 --> 33:13.320
Be it a disciple or a son,

33:14.040 --> 33:15.480
does that matter?

33:50.960 --> 33:52.040
What's wrong?

33:52.280 --> 33:53.560
What did you see?

33:57.119 --> 33:58.199
Nothing.

34:02.399 --> 34:03.520
Good work.

34:19.039 --> 34:20.119
What is this?

34:25.160 --> 34:27.080
No... Nothing.

34:27.399 --> 34:28.760
I saw it.

34:28.999 --> 34:30.399
You bought a hand cannon.

34:31.270 --> 34:32.359
That's right.

34:33.399 --> 34:35.080
Did anyone bully you?

34:35.439 --> 34:36.620
No.

34:36.640 --> 34:38.240
It's just my interest.

34:39.999 --> 34:40.700
I see.

34:40.720 --> 34:42.320
Just be careful when you use it.

34:42.999 --> 34:44.079
Where is Sizhe?

34:44.800 --> 34:47.080
He has been acting strangely.

34:48.280 --> 34:49.360
There he is.

34:53.039 --> 34:53.979
Xian.

34:53.999 --> 34:55.079
Ruoruo.

34:55.720 --> 34:56.999
I'm coming.

34:57.359 --> 34:58.180
Time to go.

34:58.200 --> 34:58.999
It is.

34:58.999 --> 35:00.340
We have been waiting for you.

35:00.360 --> 35:01.110
It's not that, Ruoruo.

35:01.120 --> 35:03.620
I'm saying
that I'm heading to Northern Qi.

35:03.640 --> 35:05.019
Northern Qi?

35:05.039 --> 35:06.959
I have discussed it with Xian.

35:06.959 --> 35:08.160
Mother agrees too.

35:09.760 --> 35:11.519
Have you figured out

35:11.519 --> 35:12.899
how to lead the commercial business?

35:12.919 --> 35:14.120
I'm working on it.

35:14.160 --> 35:15.740
It's getting clearer.

35:15.760 --> 35:17.620
I have been thinking

35:17.640 --> 35:18.800
about state credibility

35:18.800 --> 35:19.979
and currency base you said.

35:19.999 --> 35:21.019
I feel

35:21.039 --> 35:23.559
there needs to be a shop
to maintain the balance between them.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.160
Opening the shop in the Qing States

35:25.160 --> 35:27.299
is like sending myself to death.

35:27.319 --> 35:28.780
It can only be in Northern Qi.

35:28.800 --> 35:30.860
Northern Qi has just lost in the war
and is waiting for a revival.

35:30.879 --> 35:32.060
This presents us
with a good opportunity.

35:32.070 --> 35:33.339
If I can seize it,

35:33.359 --> 35:34.939
this shop will be unprecedented,

35:34.959 --> 35:37.080
and I will be the pioneer.

35:37.519 --> 35:38.499
On a small scale,

35:38.519 --> 35:39.540
I can make some money.

35:39.560 --> 35:41.140
On a large scale,

35:41.160 --> 35:42.479
the prospect of Northern Qi

35:42.479 --> 35:44.720
will be under my thumb.

35:46.810 --> 35:48.300
Have you come up with a name yet?

35:48.720 --> 35:49.459
Yes, I did.

35:49.479 --> 35:50.740
Give me some idea.

35:50.760 --> 35:51.499
You see,

35:51.519 --> 35:53.550
a shop selling rice grain
is called a rice store,

35:53.570 --> 35:55.299
and a shop selling fabric
is called a fabric store.

35:55.319 --> 35:56.859
Since this shop is related to money,

35:56.879 --> 35:58.740
it's too straightforward
if we call it a money store.

35:58.760 --> 36:00.019
It's crude.

36:00.039 --> 36:01.919
Money is silver, right?

36:03.120 --> 36:03.939
So

36:03.959 --> 36:05.200
let's call it Fan Store.

36:08.350 --> 36:10.270
Then why did you mention silver?
[*Silver store literally means "bank"]

36:10.280 --> 36:11.260
No.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.240
Here's what I think.

36:12.240 --> 36:14.260
We are the pioneers in this business.

36:14.280 --> 36:16.600
The Fan family
must be remembered for this,

36:16.600 --> 36:17.540
right?

36:17.560 --> 36:19.299
Maybe you should refine the name.

36:19.319 --> 36:20.359
If Fan Store isn't good,

36:20.359 --> 36:21.260
let's call it

36:21.280 --> 36:22.360
Xian Store?

36:22.879 --> 36:24.039
Ruo Store?

36:24.720 --> 36:25.800
Zhe Store?

36:25.879 --> 36:26.660
Forget it.

36:26.680 --> 36:28.210
I will think about it on the way.

36:28.230 --> 36:29.379
Xian, you know what?

36:29.399 --> 36:30.859
I'm so thrilled.

36:30.879 --> 36:32.760
I feel like

36:32.760 --> 36:34.800
I have finally figured out
what I'm living for.

36:34.919 --> 36:37.120
That's your life's purpose.

36:37.519 --> 36:40.160
Right, I found my life's purpose!

37:14.519 --> 37:15.210
Mr. Fan,

37:15.230 --> 37:16.600
it's the Imperial Guards.

37:23.359 --> 37:24.700
They are here to block my way.

37:24.720 --> 37:26.180
Black Cavalries, stand by.

37:26.200 --> 37:27.580
Always ready to charge.

37:27.600 --> 37:28.339
No...

37:28.359 --> 37:30.100
They are the Imperial Guards.

37:30.120 --> 37:31.299
The Emperor's troop.

37:31.319 --> 37:32.519
Don't worry.

37:34.120 --> 37:37.039
Black Cavalries is the strongest troop.

37:37.080 --> 37:37.940
We will never lose.

37:37.960 --> 37:38.819
No.

37:38.839 --> 37:40.919
That's not my concern.

37:40.919 --> 37:41.880
What Wang means is,

37:41.900 --> 37:43.620
attacking the Imperial Guards
is a serious crime.

37:43.640 --> 37:45.019
As per Mr. Chen's order,

37:45.039 --> 37:47.499
Black Cavalries obey the military order
by Inspector

37:47.519 --> 37:50.200
while in Mount Cang.

37:51.680 --> 37:53.240
Someone is coming.

37:55.160 --> 37:57.240
Isn't this an old acquaintance of mine?

38:07.280 --> 38:08.680
Mr. Fan,

38:08.720 --> 38:10.039
it has been a long time.

38:11.240 --> 38:12.620
Commander Gong, you guard the palace.

38:12.640 --> 38:14.140
Why did you leave the Capital today?

38:14.160 --> 38:16.580
His Majesty instructed me
for a task outside the palace.

38:16.600 --> 38:18.419
I wish you a smooth journey,
Commander Gong.

38:18.439 --> 38:20.680
Why? Should I make way for you?

38:20.700 --> 38:22.140
According to His Majesty's order,

38:22.160 --> 38:24.839
please come with us, Mr. Fan.

38:29.919 --> 38:31.240
You reached here

38:31.250 --> 38:32.560
right after I came down from Mount Cang.

38:32.570 --> 38:33.740
You certainly get news quickly.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.540
I only understand the order.

38:35.560 --> 38:37.959
I don't know anything else.

38:38.399 --> 38:39.299
In that case,

38:39.319 --> 38:40.200
please show me the way.

38:40.210 --> 38:41.100
We will follow behind you.

38:41.120 --> 38:42.700
The troop doesn't have to tag along.

38:42.720 --> 38:45.680
Just you, Mr. Fan.

38:46.310 --> 38:48.120
You said it's an order from His Majesty.

38:48.240 --> 38:49.920
Do you have the imperial edict?

38:52.280 --> 38:53.360
This is small.

38:54.999 --> 38:56.399
His Majesty said,

38:56.680 --> 38:57.760
"Don't be

38:58.439 --> 38:59.559
wasteful."

39:00.519 --> 39:02.700
Well, His Majesty

39:02.720 --> 39:04.640
is indeed frugal.

39:08.900 --> 39:11.295
[Follow Gong Dian]

39:24.839 --> 39:25.919
Mr. Fan,

39:27.039 --> 39:28.119
please.

40:14.720 --> 40:15.999
Mr. Fan,

40:16.230 --> 40:19.120
this is where the imperial family
admired flowers in previous years.

40:24.425 --> 40:26.645
[Hanging Temple]

40:36.879 --> 40:39.879
Built between cliffs,
hovering in midair.

40:40.280 --> 40:42.160
The legendary

40:42.439 --> 40:43.319
Hanging Temple.

40:43.319 --> 40:47.745
[Hanging Temple]

41:15.800 --> 41:18.120
This is the oldest temple
in the Qing State.

41:18.319 --> 41:19.399
Legend has it

41:19.680 --> 41:21.399
that it was built brick by brick

41:21.399 --> 41:23.919
by ascetics who believed
in the Divine Temple.

41:24.919 --> 41:26.060
All temples in the world

41:26.080 --> 41:26.959
are set up

41:26.959 --> 41:30.160
to worship the legendary Divine Temple.

41:30.319 --> 41:32.039
But only the genuine Divine Temple

41:32.240 --> 41:33.680
is unique.

41:34.760 --> 41:36.320
Still, the power of the mass

41:36.959 --> 41:38.320
can be immeasurable.

41:38.720 --> 41:40.879
Mr. Fan, you value

41:41.359 --> 41:42.439
humans more.

41:43.319 --> 41:44.399
Of course.

41:44.560 --> 41:46.600
That's why we call it the human world.

41:48.479 --> 41:50.519
The Chrysanthemum Festival
is in a few days.

41:51.039 --> 41:52.320
Our task

41:52.879 --> 41:54.280
is to carry all of these

41:54.399 --> 41:55.680
up there.

41:56.120 --> 41:57.660
What am I needed here for?

41:57.680 --> 41:58.879
His Majesty said

41:59.160 --> 42:00.499
you have to carry

42:00.519 --> 42:02.359
these pots up there by yourself.

42:04.080 --> 42:06.600
What's so special about them?

42:06.919 --> 42:08.120
I don't know.

42:08.439 --> 42:10.680
I'm only following orders.

42:51.810 --> 42:53.240
Is it held every three years?

42:53.839 --> 42:55.240
It has become a tradition.

42:56.039 --> 42:57.899
This is the very opportunity

42:57.919 --> 42:59.240
for those with evil will.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
